    "name": "Dungeon Directive",
    "steam_appid": 3751720,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Dungeon Directive is an open-ended guild master simulator RPG!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3751720/extras/a9e242ed34972aa90a03297f28eb0e85.avif?t=1753231612\" width=1600 height=516 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the new guild master, it is your job to rebuild the guild, recruit capable and unpredictable heroes, and send them into the depths. Each expedition brings new dangers, treasures, and stories. Some heroes will return stronger than ever. Others may not return at all. With time, your guild will grow not just in power, but in reputation and history.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a place where bonds matter and choices have lasting impact. Heroes form attachments, hold grudges, and even build families. The deeper your roots grow, the stronger your legacy becomes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unique NPC Heroes.\u00a0</strong>Each hero has randomized stats, abilities and rankings along with personality shaped by traits, moods, memories, and experiences. These personalities influence everything from quest choices to loyalty and teamwork.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3751720/extras/f3f1a58388eade9c847c5032c1f95280.poster.avif?t=1753231612\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3751720/extras/f3f1a58388eade9c847c5032c1f95280.webm?t=1753231612\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3751720/extras/f3f1a58388eade9c847c5032c1f95280.mp4?t=1753231612\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Guild Hall Management.\u00a0</strong>Customize your guild hall with visual upgrades and decorations to make it feel like home. Personalize the space, track your heroes, review quests, serve thirsty heroes and manage every part of your growing guild from one central location.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3751720/extras/84b4dcfd4ca2c725eeeb0173ab539349.poster.avif?t=1753231612\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3751720/extras/84b4dcfd4ca2c725eeeb0173ab539349.webm?t=1753231612\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3751720/extras/84b4dcfd4ca2c725eeeb0173ab539349.mp4?t=1753231612\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Living World.\u00a0</strong>Time moves forward whether you act or not. Heroes age, new faces arrive, and some vanish forever. Choices made now ripple through the years. Your guild is not just a building. It is a community built on memory and meaning.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3751720/extras/36ced8e0b67e7a6c2f1dc22e7422d40a.poster.avif?t=1753231612\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3751720/extras/36ced8e0b67e7a6c2f1dc22e7422d40a.webm?t=1753231612\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3751720/extras/36ced8e0b67e7a6c2f1dc22e7422d40a.mp4?t=1753231612\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Deep Quest System.\u00a0</strong>Build parties based on class, skill, personality, and relationship dynamics. Quests vary in length and danger. Not every party comes back the same.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3751720/extras/ce17f7888ebc24206e1452426cd53718.poster.avif?t=1753231612\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3751720/extras/ce17f7888ebc24206e1452426cd53718.webm?t=1753231612\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3751720/extras/ce17f7888ebc24206e1452426cd53718.mp4?t=1753231612\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Relationships and Storytelling.\u00a0</strong>You and the heroes interact with one another in meaningful ways. You can build friendships, form rivalries, or fall in love. These bonds shape the future of your guild.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Lineage and Generations.\u00a0</strong>Both you and your heroes can marry, raise children, and start families. Traits, skills, and history are passed down through generations.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>1\u20134 Player Multiplayer.\u00a0</strong>Play solo or bring up to three friends into your guild. Work together to manage heroes, plan quests, and make tough decisions. Share resources, build your guild cooperatively, or each take charge of different parts of your growing organization.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Auto Battler Combat.\u00a0</strong>Combat is handled through an auto battler system. Heroes act automatically based on their stats, equipment, and traits with some assistance from spell casting by the guild master.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3751720/extras/bd5eb085213fb8c5e251d903e6baad6f.poster.avif?t=1753231612\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3751720/extras/bd5eb085213fb8c5e251d903e6baad6f.webm?t=1753231612\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3751720/extras/bd5eb085213fb8c5e251d903e6baad6f.mp4?t=1753231612\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Crafting and Inventory.\u00a0</strong>Collect rare materials from dungeon runs and use them to create powerful equipment. Items can boost stats or unlock new tactics.</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Dungeon Directive is an open-ended guild master simulator RPG!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3751720/extras/a9e242ed34972aa90a03297f28eb0e85.avif?t=1753231612\" width=1600 height=516 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the new guild master, it is your job to rebuild the guild, recruit capable and unpredictable heroes, and send them into the depths. Each expedition brings new dangers, treasures, and stories. Some heroes will return stronger than ever. Others may not return at all. With time, your guild will grow not just in power, but in reputation and history.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a place where bonds matter and choices have lasting impact. Heroes form attachments, hold grudges, and even build families. The deeper your roots grow, the stronger your legacy becomes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unique NPC Heroes.\u00a0</strong>Each hero has randomized stats, abilities and rankings along with personality shaped by traits, moods, memories, and experiences. These personalities influence everything from quest choices to loyalty and teamwork.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3751720/extras/f3f1a58388eade9c847c5032c1f95280.poster.avif?t=1753231612\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3751720/extras/f3f1a58388eade9c847c5032c1f95280.webm?t=1753231612\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3751720/extras/f3f1a58388eade9c847c5032c1f95280.mp4?t=1753231612\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Guild Hall Management.\u00a0</strong>Customize your guild hall with visual upgrades and decorations to make it feel like home. Personalize the space, track your heroes, review quests, serve thirsty heroes and manage every part of your growing guild from one central location.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3751720/extras/84b4dcfd4ca2c725eeeb0173ab539349.poster.avif?t=1753231612\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3751720/extras/84b4dcfd4ca2c725eeeb0173ab539349.webm?t=1753231612\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3751720/extras/84b4dcfd4ca2c725eeeb0173ab539349.mp4?t=1753231612\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Living World.\u00a0</strong>Time moves forward whether you act or not. Heroes age, new faces arrive, and some vanish forever. Choices made now ripple through the years. Your guild is not just a building. It is a community built on memory and meaning.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3751720/extras/36ced8e0b67e7a6c2f1dc22e7422d40a.poster.avif?t=1753231612\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3751720/extras/36ced8e0b67e7a6c2f1dc22e7422d40a.webm?t=1753231612\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3751720/extras/36ced8e0b67e7a6c2f1dc22e7422d40a.mp4?t=1753231612\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Deep Quest System.\u00a0</strong>Build parties based on class, skill, personality, and relationship dynamics. Quests vary in length and danger. Not every party comes back the same.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3751720/extras/ce17f7888ebc24206e1452426cd53718.poster.avif?t=1753231612\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3751720/extras/ce17f7888ebc24206e1452426cd53718.webm?t=1753231612\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3751720/extras/ce17f7888ebc24206e1452426cd53718.mp4?t=1753231612\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Relationships and Storytelling.\u00a0</strong>You and the heroes interact with one another in meaningful ways. You can build friendships, form rivalries, or fall in love. These bonds shape the future of your guild.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Lineage and Generations.\u00a0</strong>Both you and your heroes can marry, raise children, and start families. Traits, skills, and history are passed down through generations.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>1\u20134 Player Multiplayer.\u00a0</strong>Play solo or bring up to three friends into your guild. Work together to manage heroes, plan quests, and make tough decisions. Share resources, build your guild cooperatively, or each take charge of different parts of your growing organization.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Auto Battler Combat.\u00a0</strong>Combat is handled through an auto battler system. Heroes act automatically based on their stats, equipment, and traits with some assistance from spell casting by the guild master.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3751720/extras/bd5eb085213fb8c5e251d903e6baad6f.poster.avif?t=1753231612\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3751720/extras/bd5eb085213fb8c5e251d903e6baad6f.webm?t=1753231612\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3751720/extras/bd5eb085213fb8c5e251d903e6baad6f.mp4?t=1753231612\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Crafting and Inventory.\u00a0</strong>Collect rare materials from dungeon runs and use them to create powerful equipment. Items can boost stats or unlock new tactics.</p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "You\u2019ve taken over the guild hall in the center of town near a mysterious dungeon portal. With a small roster of heroes and limited resources, it\u2019s your job to rebuild the guild, send parties into the depths, and shape a legacy that lasts for generations. What future will your choices create?",
